msgid "%1$s files, recorded %2$s."
msgstr "%1$s 个文件，记录于 %2$s。"

msgid ""
"%1$s of %2$s files recorded. Press the button again and it will carry on "
"from where it stopped — nothing already recorded is read twice."
msgstr "已记录 %1$s / %2$s 个文件。再按一次按钮将从上次停止处继续——已记录的文件不会重复读取。"

msgid ""
"%1$s of %2$s files. This site has more files than one run reads, so press "
"the button again to carry on — it resumes rather than starting over."
msgstr "%1$s / %2$s 个文件。本站文件数超过单次读取上限，再按一次按钮即可继续——会从断点续扫，不会从头开始。"

msgid ""
"A fingerprint of every core, plugin and theme file is recorded while the "
"site is known good. Comparing against it shows what has changed since. "
"Nothing is ever deleted or changed by this: it reports, and you decide."
msgstr ""
"在站点确认无恙时，记录核心、插件和主题每个文件的指纹。之后比对即可看出哪些文件发生了变化。此功能不会删除或改动任何文件：只负责报告，决定权在你。"

msgid ""
"A partial baseline cannot be compared with. Every file it has not reached "
"would look like a file that has been deleted, so comparing is held back "
"until the baseline is complete."
msgstr "不完整的基准无法用于比对。尚未扫描到的文件都会被误判为「已被删除」，因此基准未完成前比对功能暂不可用。"

msgid "Account"
msgstr "账号"

msgid "Account name"
msgstr "账号名称"

msgid ""
"Accounts not used for %1$s days or more, out of %2$s on this site. Nothing "
"is changed automatically: a quiet account may be one you use twice a year, "
"and only you know which."
msgstr "本站共 %2$s 个账号，其中 %1$s 天以上未使用的如下。不会自动做任何处理：长期不用的账号可能只是半年才用一次的，只有你自己知道。"

msgid "Activate"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Activate it"
msgstr "去启用"

msgid "Active — lifetime licence."
msgstr "已激活——终身授权。"

msgid "Active."
msgstr "已激活。"

msgid ""
"Add this key to your authenticator app — choose \"enter a setup key\" and "
"type it exactly as shown. Then enter the six-digit code the app produces to "
"prove the key was entered correctly."
msgstr "将此密钥添加到你的验证器应用——选择「输入设置密钥」，并原样输入上方内容。然后输入应用生成的 6 位数字，以证明密钥填写正确。"

msgid "Address detection"
msgstr "地址识别"

msgid "Anti-bot challenge"
msgstr "人机验证"

msgid "Arrived through %s."
msgstr "经由 %s 到达。"

msgid "At8 Security Pro"
msgstr "At8 Security Pro"

msgid "At8 Security Pro needs the free At8 Security plugin."
msgstr "At8 Security Pro 需要免费版 At8 Security 插件。"

msgid ""
"At8 Security Pro requires PHP %s or newer. The add-on has been disabled to "
"keep your site online."
msgstr "At8 Security Pro 需要 PHP %s 或更高版本。附加组件已自动停用，以保证站点正常运行。"

msgid "Authenticator code"
msgstr "验证器代码"

msgid "Baseline"
msgstr "基准"

msgid "Baseline recorded: %s files."
msgstr "基准已记录：%s 个文件。"

msgid "Begin setup"
msgstr "开始设置"

msgid ""
"Behind a CDN or a reverse proxy every request arrives from the same few "
"addresses, so the rate limiter would count every visitor in the world as one"
" person. Switching this on lets the plugin work out which network is in "
"front of the site and read the visitor address from the header that network "
"controls."
msgstr ""
"站点位于 CDN "
"或反向代理之后时，所有请求都来自相同的少数几个地址，限流会把全世界访客当成同一个人。开启后插件会自动识别前置网络，并从该网络控制的请求头中读取访客真实地址。"

msgid ""
"Both keys are needed. Until they are filled in, the built-in arithmetic "
"question stays in place rather than the form going without a check."
msgstr "两把密钥都必填。填写完成前，登录表单继续使用内置算术题，不会完全没有验证。"

msgid "Build again"
msgstr "重新构建"

msgid "Build baseline"
msgstr "构建基准"

msgid "Carry on"
msgstr "继续"

msgid "Carry on recording the baseline?"
msgstr "继续记录基准？"

msgid ""
"Changes under Plugins or Themes usually mean an update was installed — check"
" the plugin list against what you last installed before reading anything "
"into them. Changes under WordPress core are only expected after a core "
"update. A file that appeared in a folder that nothing writes to is the one "
"worth opening."
msgstr ""
"「插件」或「主题」下的变动通常只是安装了更新——先对照最近装过什么，再下结论。「WordPress "
"核心」下的变动只有核心更新后才属正常。真正值得点开查看的，是出现在无人写入目录中的新增文件。"

msgid "Check now"
msgstr "立即检查"

msgid "Compare now"
msgstr "立即比对"

msgid "Comparison finished: %1$s appeared, %2$s differ, %3$s have gone."
msgstr "比对完成：新增 %1$s 个，内容有差异 %2$s 个，已消失 %3$s 个。"

msgid "Continues from where the last run stopped."
msgstr "从上次停止处继续。"

msgid "Could not reach the licence server on the last check."
msgstr "上次检查无法连接授权服务器。"

msgid "Count an account as inactive after (days)"
msgstr "账号多少天未使用视为闲置（天）"

msgid "Days"
msgstr "天"

msgid "Delete baseline"
msgstr "删除基准"

msgid "Detect CDN and proxy address ranges automatically"
msgstr "自动识别 CDN 与代理地址段"

msgid "Detection"
msgstr "识别"

msgid ""
"Development mode is on in wp-config.php: no licence is checked here, and the"
" features run regardless of the key."
msgstr "wp-config.php 中开发模式已开启：此站点不检查授权，功能与密钥状态无关地正常运行。"

msgid "Development mode — no licence is checked on this install."
msgstr "开发模式——本站不检查授权。"

msgid "Do this when you are satisfied the site is clean."
msgstr "确认站点干净之后再执行。"

msgid ""
"Each person sets this up on their own profile screen; nothing here forces it"
" on an account that has not been set up. The roles chosen below are the ones"
" this site asks to use it — the account holder sees a reminder until they "
"do."
msgstr ""
"每个人在各自的资料页自行设置；这里不会强制任何未设置的账号启用。下方选择的角色是站点「建议启用」的对象——账号持有人会一直看到提醒，直到完成设置。"

msgid "Enter a licence key first."
msgstr "请先填写授权密钥。"

msgid "Every file matches the baseline."
msgstr "所有文件与基准一致。"

msgid "Expired."
msgstr "已过期。"

msgid "File integrity"
msgstr "文件完整性"

msgid "Files that appeared"
msgstr "新增的文件"

msgid "Files that have gone"
msgstr "消失的文件"

msgid "Files whose contents differ"
msgstr "内容有差异的文件"

msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "完成设置"

msgid "Forget this browser"
msgstr "取消信任此浏览器"

msgid "From the Turnstile section of your Cloudflare account."
msgstr "来自你 Cloudflare 账户的 Turnstile 版块。"

msgid "How many"
msgstr "数量"

msgid "Inactive accounts"
msgstr "闲置账号"

msgid "Issue a new set before you need one."
msgstr "在需要之前先换发一组新的。"

msgid "Issue a new set of recovery codes"
msgstr "换发一组新的恢复代码"

msgid "It is installed but not active, so none of these features are running."
msgstr "已安装但未启用，因此这些功能都没有运行。"

msgid "It is not installed, so none of these features are running."
msgstr "尚未安装，因此这些功能都没有运行。"

msgid ""
"Keep a recovery code somewhere safe once setup is complete. It is the only "
"way back in if you lose the app."
msgstr "设置完成后请妥善保存恢复代码。万一丢失验证器，这是唯一的找回方式。"

msgid "Key type"
msgstr "密钥类型"

msgid "Last comparison"
msgstr "上次比对"

msgid "Last confirmed by the licence server: %s."
msgstr "授权服务器上次确认时间：%s。"

msgid "Last recorded"
msgstr "最近记录"

msgid "Last used"
msgstr "最近使用"

msgid "Licence"
msgstr "授权"

msgid "Licence key"
msgstr "授权密钥"

msgid "Manage"
msgstr "管理"

msgid ""
"Networks recognised: %s. More can be added with the at8sec_pro_cdn_providers"
" filter."
msgstr "已识别的网络：%s。可通过 at8sec_pro_cdn_providers 过滤器添加更多。"

msgid ""
"New recovery codes have been issued. The previous set no longer works. Save "
"these now, they are shown once."
msgstr "新恢复代码已换发，旧的一组全部作废。请立即保存——它们只显示这一次。"

msgid "No action was requested."
msgstr "没有请求任何操作。"

msgid "No known CDN network in front of this request."
msgstr "此请求前方没有已知的 CDN 网络。"

msgid "No licence key is stored."
msgstr "尚未保存授权密钥。"

msgid "No licence key stored."
msgstr "未保存授权密钥。"

msgid "No role"
msgstr "无角色"

msgid ""
"Nobody is locked out by this list. It decides who is asked, and who is "
"reminded."
msgstr "此名单不会把任何人拒之门外，只决定谁被要求启用、谁会收到提醒。"

msgid "None yet."
msgstr "暂无。"

msgid "None."
msgstr "无。"

msgid "Not valid for this site."
msgstr "对本站点无效。"

msgid "Nothing recorded"
msgstr "暂无记录"

msgid "Nothing yet."
msgstr "暂无。"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "关闭"

msgid "Off."
msgstr "已关闭。"

msgid "Offer two-factor authentication on this site"
msgstr "在本站点提供两步验证"

msgid "On"
msgstr "开启"

msgid "On."
msgstr "已开启。"

msgid "On. Recovery codes left: %d."
msgstr "已开启。剩余恢复代码：%d 个。"

msgid "Only the account holder can set this up."
msgstr "只有账号本人能完成设置。"

msgid ""
"Paste the key you were sent. The stored key is shown shortened; typing a new"
" one replaces it."
msgstr "粘贴你收到的密钥。已保存的密钥只显示缩略形式；输入新密钥将直接替换。"

msgid "Plugins"
msgstr "插件"

msgid "Pro tools"
msgstr "Pro 工具"

msgid "Progress"
msgstr "进度"

msgid "Quiet for longer than the threshold"
msgstr "超过阈值未使用"

msgid "Read every file again and list what differs."
msgstr "重新读取全部文件并列出差异。"

msgid "Read every file again and list what differs?"
msgstr "重新读取全部文件并列出差异？"

msgid ""
"Record the site as it is now? A baseline that already exists is replaced."
msgstr "按当前状态记录站点？已有的基准将被替换。"

msgid "Recovery codes"
msgstr "恢复代码"

msgid "Recovery codes left: %d."
msgstr "剩余恢复代码：%d 个。"

msgid "Registered"
msgstr "注册时间"

msgid "Release this site"
msgstr "解绑此站点"

msgid ""
"Release this site from the licence? The key can then be used on a different "
"site."
msgstr "将此站点从授权中解绑？密钥之后可绑定到其他站点。"

msgid "Remember a browser for (days)"
msgstr "信任浏览器的天数"

msgid "Remember this device for %d days"
msgstr "信任此设备 %d 天"

msgid "Remove the stored fingerprints and the last result?"
msgstr "删除已保存的指纹和上次比对结果？"

msgid "Removes the stored fingerprints and the last result."
msgstr "删除已保存的指纹和上次比对结果。"

msgid ""
"Replaces the arithmetic question on the sign-in form with a hosted "
"challenge. This is the one feature here that talks to a third party — the "
"widget is loaded from Cloudflare and the answer is checked by Cloudflare. "
"Leave it off to keep everything on this server."
msgstr ""
"用云端托管的人机验证替换登录表单上的算术题。这是这里唯一与第三方通信的功能——组件从 Cloudflare 加载，答案也由 Cloudflare "
"校验。不想依赖外部服务就保持关闭。"

msgid "Replaces the current set. Any unused codes stop working."
msgstr "将替换当前一组，未用完的代码全部作废。"

msgid "Reset two-factor for this account"
msgstr "重置此账号的两步验证"

msgid "Role"
msgstr "角色"

msgid "Roles asked to use it"
msgstr "建议启用的角色"

msgid "Run %s."
msgstr "运行 %s。"

msgid "Runs until %s."
msgstr "有效期至 %s。"

msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "保存更改"

msgid "Saved."
msgstr "已保存。"

msgid "Secret key"
msgstr "私钥"

msgid "Set up"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Showing the first %1$s of %2$s."
msgstr "显示前 %1$s 项（共 %2$s 项）。"

msgid "Site key"
msgstr "站点密钥"

msgid ""
"Six digits, or one of your recovery codes. Leave empty if two-factor is not "
"set up on your account."
msgstr "输入 6 位验证码或一个恢复代码。你的账号未开启两步验证时留空即可。"

msgid "Six-digit code from the app"
msgstr "验证器应用中的 6 位验证码"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid ""
"Stored on this server and never printed back into this page. Leave empty to "
"keep the one already saved."
msgstr "只保存在本服务器上，绝不会回显到页面里。留空则保持已保存的密钥不变。"

msgid ""
"That code was not accepted. Check the clock on your device and enter the "
"current code."
msgstr "验证码未被接受。请校准设备时钟后输入当前验证码。"

msgid ""
"That code was not accepted. Check the clock on your device, then try the "
"current code — or use one of your recovery codes."
msgstr "验证码未被接受。请校准设备时钟后重试当前验证码——或改用恢复代码。"

msgid "The add-on for At8 Security. Requires the free At8 Security plugin."
msgstr "At8 Security 附加组件。需要免费版 At8 Security 插件。"

msgid ""
"The anti-bot check did not complete. Please reload the page and try again."
msgstr "人机验证未完成，请刷新页面后重试。"

msgid "The anti-bot check was not passed. Please try again."
msgstr "人机验证未通过，请重试。"

msgid "The baseline and the last comparison have been removed."
msgstr "基准和上次比对结果已删除。"

msgid ""
"The comparison was capped before it finished, so the lists below are a lower"
" bound."
msgstr "比对因达到上限而提前结束，下方列表只是下限。"

msgid ""
"The decision is made again on every request, so a site that stops using a "
"CDN stops trusting it straight away. Only the note above is stored."
msgstr "识别在每次请求时重新进行，站点不再使用某个 CDN 后会立即不再信任它。只会保存上方的说明文字。"

msgid "The hosted challenge is in use on the sign-in form."
msgstr "登录表单正在使用云端托管的人机验证。"

msgid "The licence server accepted this key for this site."
msgstr "授权服务器已接受此密钥绑定本站点。"

msgid "The licence server answered with HTTP %d."
msgstr "授权服务器返回 HTTP %d。"

msgid "The licence server confirmed this key."
msgstr "授权服务器已确认此密钥。"

msgid ""
"The licence server could not be reached, so the features keep running for "
"another %d days. A security feature is not switched off because a licence "
"server had a bad afternoon."
msgstr "无法连接授权服务器，功能将继续运行 %d 天。安全功能不会因为授权服务器一时故障而被关闭。"

msgid "The licence server did not accept this key for this site."
msgstr "授权服务器未接受此密钥绑定本站点。"

msgid "The licence server sent a response that could not be read."
msgstr "授权服务器返回了无法解析的响应。"

msgid "The next sign-in here will ask for a code again."
msgstr "下次在此登录将重新要求输入验证码。"

msgid ""
"The scan was capped before it finished, so some files were not examined. The"
" lists below are a lower bound."
msgstr "扫描因达到上限而提前结束，部分文件未检查。下方列表只是下限。"

msgid "Themes"
msgstr "主题"

msgid "There is no two-factor setup in progress for this account."
msgstr "此账号当前没有进行中的两步验证设置。"

msgid ""
"This account has started setting up two-factor authentication. Only the "
"account holder can finish it, and only they ever see the key."
msgstr "此账号已开始设置两步验证。只有账号本人能完成设置，密钥也只有本人可见。"

msgid ""
"This account uses two-factor authentication. Enter the six-digit code from "
"your authenticator app to finish signing in."
msgstr "此账号已启用两步验证。请输入验证器应用中的 6 位验证码完成登录。"

msgid "This browser is no longer remembered."
msgstr "此浏览器已取消信任。"

msgid "This licence does not expire."
msgstr "此授权永久有效。"

msgid "This request"
msgstr "当前请求"

msgid ""
"This site asks accounts in your role to use two-factor authentication. <a "
"href=\"%s\">Set it up on your profile</a> — a password alone is not enough "
"for the access you have."
msgstr "本站点建议你所在的角色启用两步验证。<a href=\"%s\">前往资料页设置</a>——以你的权限，光有密码并不够。"

msgid ""
"This site has been released from the licence. The key can now be used "
"elsewhere."
msgstr "此站点已从授权中解绑，密钥现在可以绑定其他站点。"

msgid ""
"This site looks like it is behind %s, but the detection above is off. Until "
"it is switched on, every visitor is seen as coming from the same address."
msgstr "本站点似乎位于 %s 之后，但上方的识别功能未开启。在开启之前，所有访客都会被视为来自同一个地址。"

msgid "Time based"
msgstr "基于时间"

msgid "Turn on two-factor authentication"
msgstr "开启两步验证"

msgid ""
"Turn two-factor authentication off for this account? Their recovery codes "
"are discarded as well."
msgstr "关闭此账号的两步验证？其恢复代码也将一并作废。"

msgid "Turn two-factor off"
msgstr "关闭两步验证"

msgid "Two-factor authentication"
msgstr "两步验证"

msgid ""
"Two-factor authentication has been turned off for that account, and its "
"recovery codes have been discarded."
msgstr "该账号的两步验证已关闭，恢复代码已作废。"

msgid "Two-factor authentication is off for your account."
msgstr "你的账号尚未开启两步验证。"

msgid ""
"Two-factor authentication is on. Your recovery codes are below — save them "
"now, they are shown once."
msgstr "两步验证已开启。恢复代码如下——请立即保存，它们只显示这一次。"

msgid "Two-factor authentication is switched off for this site."
msgstr "本站点的两步验证已关闭。"

msgid ""
"Uploads, caches and backup folders are left out, because those are supposed "
"to change."
msgstr "上传、缓存和备份目录不参与比对——它们本来就经常变。"

msgid "Use the hosted challenge on the sign-in form"
msgstr "登录表单使用云端托管验证"

msgid ""
"Use this when the account holder has lost both their authenticator and their"
" recovery codes — for example when their phone is gone. It leaves the "
"account protected by its password alone until they set two-factor up again."
msgstr "当账号持有人同时丢失验证器和恢复代码时使用——例如手机丢了。重置后该账号仅靠密码保护，直到重新设置两步验证。"

msgid ""
"Used by the report on the Pro tools tab. Nothing happens to an account "
"automatically."
msgstr "供「Pro 工具」选项卡的报告使用。不会对任何账号自动执行操作。"

msgid "What"
msgstr "对象"

msgid ""
"When an account was last used is recorded by this plugin, so the first list "
"can only go back as far as the add-on has been installed. The second list is"
" accounts nothing has been recorded for at all."
msgstr "账号最近使用时间由本插件记录，因此第一份列表只能追溯到附加组件安装之后。第二份列表是从未有使用记录的账号。"

msgid "WordPress core"
msgstr "WordPress 核心"

msgid "You are not allowed to do that."
msgstr "你没有权限执行该操作。"

msgid ""
"You will be asked for a code the next time you sign in on a device you have "
"not marked as remembered."
msgstr "下次在未标记为「信任」的设备上登录时，将要求输入验证码。"

msgid ""
"You will need an authenticator app on your phone — any app that supports "
"time-based codes will do. Nothing is sent to a third party; the key stays on"
" this server and in your app."
msgstr "你需要在手机上安装一个验证器应用——任何支持基于时间验证码的应用都可以。不会向第三方发送任何数据；密钥只保存在本服务器和你的应用里。"

msgid "Your password alone will sign you in again."
msgstr "之后仅凭密码即可登录。"

msgid "Your role is one this site asks to use two-factor authentication."
msgstr "你所在的角色属于本站点建议启用两步验证的范围。"

msgid "Zero switches the \"remember this device\" option off entirely."
msgstr "设为 0 将完全关闭「记住此设备」功能。"

msgid ""
"each one signs you in a single time if you lose your authenticator. Store "
"them somewhere other than this browser."
msgstr "丢失验证器时，每个代码可使用一次。请保存在这台浏览器之外的地方。"

msgid "never"
msgstr "从未"

msgid "none"
msgstr "无"

msgid "over IPv6"
msgstr "IPv6 网络下"
